#: ../../library/index.rst:4
msgid "OpenMV MicroPython libraries"
msgstr "OpenMV MicroPython 函式庫"

#: ../../library/index.rst:8
msgid "Important summary of this section"
msgstr "本節重要摘要"

#: ../../library/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"MicroPython provides built-in modules that mirror the functionality of the "
":ref:`Python standard library <micropython_lib_python>` (e.g. :mod:`os`, "
":mod:`time`), as well as :ref:`MicroPython-specific modules "
"<micropython_lib_micropython>` (e.g. :mod:`bluetooth`, :mod:`machine`)."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython 提供了與 :ref:`Python 標準函式庫 <micropython_lib_python>` 功能相對應的內建模組（例如 "
":mod:`os`\\ 、\\ :mod:`time`\\ ），以及 :ref:`MicroPython 專屬模組 "
"<micropython_lib_micropython>`\\ （例如 :mod:`bluetooth`\\ 、\\ :mod:`machine`\\"
" ）。"

#: ../../library/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"Most Python standard library modules implement a subset of the functionality"
" of the equivalent Python module, and in a few cases provide some "
"MicroPython-specific extensions (e.g. :mod:`array`, :mod:`os`)"
msgstr ""
"大多數 Python 標準函式庫模組僅實作對應 Python 模組功能的一個子集，在少數情況下也會提供一些 MicroPython 專屬的擴充功能（例如"
" :mod:`array`\\ 、\\ :mod:`os`\\ ）"

#: ../../library/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"Due to resource constraints or other limitations, some ports or firmware "
"versions may not include all the functionality documented here."
msgstr "由於資源限制或其他因素，某些移植版本或韌體版本可能不會包含此處所記載的所有功能。"

#: ../../library/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"To allow for extensibility, some built-in modules can be :ref:`extended from"
" Python code <micropython_lib_extending>` loaded onto the device filesystem."
msgstr ""
"為了便於擴充，某些內建模組可以透過載入到裝置檔案系統上的 :ref:`Python 程式碼加以擴充 "
"<micropython_lib_extending>`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"This chapter describes modules (function and class libraries) which are "
"built into MicroPython. This documentation in general aspires to describe "
"all modules and functions/classes which are implemented in the MicroPython "
"project. However, MicroPython is highly configurable, and each port to a "
"particular board/embedded system may include only a subset of the available "
"MicroPython libraries."
msgstr ""
"本章說明內建於 MicroPython 中的模組（函式與類別函式庫）。本文件大致上力求說明 MicroPython "
"專案中所實作的所有模組與函式／類別。然而，MicroPython 具有高度可設定性，針對特定開發板／嵌入式系統的每個移植版本可能僅包含可用 "
"MicroPython 函式庫的一個子集。"

#: ../../library/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"With that in mind, please be warned that some functions/classes in a module "
"(or even the entire module) described in this documentation **may be "
"unavailable** in a particular build of MicroPython on a particular system. "
"The best place to find general information of the availability/non-"
"availability of a particular feature is the \"General Information\" section "
"which contains information pertaining to a specific :term:`MicroPython "
"port`."
msgstr ""
"有鑑於此，請注意本文件所述模組中的某些函式／類別（甚至整個模組）在特定系統上的特定 MicroPython 組建中\\ **可能無法使用**\\ "
"。要瞭解特定功能是否可用的最佳資訊來源是「General Information」一節，其中包含與特定 :term:`MicroPython port`"
" 相關的資訊。"

#: ../../library/index.rst:37
msgid ""
"On some ports you are able to discover the available, built-in libraries "
"that can be imported by entering the following at the :term:`REPL`::"
msgstr "在某些移植版本上，您可以在 :term:`REPL` 輸入以下指令來探索可匯入的內建函式庫：："

#: ../../library/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"Beyond the built-in libraries described in this documentation, many more "
"modules from the Python standard library, as well as further MicroPython "
"extensions to it, can be found in :term:`micropython-lib`."
msgstr ""
"除了本文件所述的內建函式庫外，許多來自 Python 標準函式庫的模組以及更多對其的 MicroPython 擴充，皆可在 "
":term:`micropython-lib` 中找到。"

#: ../../library/index.rst:49
msgid "Python standard libraries and micro-libraries"
msgstr "Python 標準函式庫與微型函式庫"

#: ../../library/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"The following standard Python libraries have been \"micro-ified\" to fit in "
"with the philosophy of MicroPython.  They provide the core functionality of "
"that module and are intended to be a drop-in replacement for the standard "
"Python library."
msgstr ""
"以下標準 Python 函式庫已被「微型化」以符合 MicroPython 的理念。它們提供該模組的核心功能，並設計為標準 Python "
"函式庫的即插即用替代品。"

